  "title": "v1.0.1: Offers an unlisted C5A3ZG part number",
  "content": "<p>Searching for “STM32C5A3ZG” (the part number stated on the <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/evaluation-tools/nucleo-c5a3zg.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow ugc\">NUCLEO-C5A3ZG Product Page</a>), CubeMX v1.0.1 offers STM32C5A3ZGT<u><strong>6</strong></u> and STM32C5A3ZGT<u><strong>7</strong></u></p><p> </p><p>The latest Datasheet (DS15137, Rev 2) does not list STM32C5A3ZGT<u><strong>7</strong></u> as a valid ordering code, but it does have STM32C5A3ZGT<u><strong>3</strong></u> - which is not in the CubeMX2 list:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/35f8d63a-a769-42ce-a3f3-ac7b0cd47028.png\" /></figure><p>:</p><p> </p>",
